  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>饮用此药水时，你获得对某种伤害类型的抗性，持续1小时。DM可以自行选定伤害类型，或从下表中随机选择。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>[[/r d10]] </strong></th>\n<th><strong> 伤害类型 </strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.1A0487DD4E1E5DB8]{强酸}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.7F76E1C3445A298D]{冷冻}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.E4441C5846053CF7]{火焰}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.D65C1CEA85F72C27]{力场}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.4D60697BB4C4F99E]{闪电}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.6678FBCE5053C4F9]{黯蚀}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.BA06FFE37A326CFD]{毒素}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.F384D7728CA043B0]{心灵}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.3BF53FC51F0AD47A]{光耀}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.50AA1EDB633FD33C]{雷鸣}</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
